<title>JAPAN: Sotetsu Trans - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sotetsu Trans - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.93		vs	    8.04</p>
<p> Operating	  535    million    vs	  513    million</p>
<p> Current	    605    million    vs	  635    million</p>
<p> Net		  322    million    vs	  327    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.04 yen	  vs	   16.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sotetsu Transportation Co Ltd heads the transportation division of the Tokyu Corp..</p>
</text>
